OL,3,GNEWSATown 'held to ransom' over
OL,4,Abuilding site collapse
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe Health and Safety Executive (HSE)
OL,7,Fhas been accused of holding a town "to
OL,8,Fransom" over disruption caused
OL,9,Ffollowing a partial collapse at a
OL,10,Fbuilding site last month.
OL,12,FTwo people were taken to hospital after
OL,13,Fan apartment block under construction
OL,14,Fpartly collapsed alongside scaffolding
OL,15,Fon the A4260 Cherwell Street in Banbury
OL,16,Fon 21 October closing the road for nine
OL,17,Fdays.
OL,23,APub: 17-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB S Eng NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
FL,338,330,200,160,0,100
