OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F337A1794896848
OL,1,W5j 5Qws js17kjc15 js57kj#4
OL,2,W//%*// //%Q,. *,$%**,%-,* %%**,! ,,,,,,
OL,3,GNEWSATown 'held to ransom' over
OL,4,Abuilding site collapse
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe road has been partially opened and
OL,7,Fcouncillor Paul-Austin Sargent
OL,8,Fcriticised the HSE's communication with
OL,9,Fresidents affected, saying it was "not
OL,10,Fgood enough".
OL,12,FIn a statement, the HSE said it was
OL,13,F"providing advice" to the owner of the
OL,14,Fsite - which is "responsible for the
OL,15,Fworks to make the site safe and prevent
OL,16,Ffurther injury".
OL,23,APub: 17-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
